    $section(35,'INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY',function():void{?><p>Each Party retains pre-existing IP. Project-specific deliverables are governed by the agreed contract. DISTILLOGIC retains its methodologies, templates, frameworks, know-how and reusable tools. Transfer may be subject to full payment.</p><?php });
    $section(36,'CONFIDENTIALITY',function():void{?><p>Confidential information is protected under the applicable NDA, MSA and law. This SOW is Commercial Confidential.</p><?php });
